// documentation/13-las-cloud-string.md (12d A File Format sec 1.5.18).
//
// Two las_cloud_data strings with inline data blocks:
//   "SITE SCAN"  — tagged records   (points_v12_p2: x y z i rn rc sd fe
//                  cl sr ud id c) — a ground grid, a building cluster and
//                  scattered vegetation returns.
//   "ROAD SCAN"  — compact records  (compact_points_v10_p0: same values,
//                  same order, no tags).
//
// LAS classifications used: 2 = ground, 5 = high vegetation, 6 = building.
// Coordinates: MGA2020 Zone 56 (load with System "Australia - MGA2020",
// Zone 56).
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

